<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <title>Olho no Mar — Comando & Alerta SOS Guarda-Vidas</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #020617;
      --bg-card: #0f172a;
      --bg-input: #090d16;
      --border: #1e293b;
      --border-light: #334155;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --sky: #0284c7;
      --sky-hover: #0ea5e9;
      --sky-text: #38bdf8;
      --emerald: #059669;
      --emerald-text: #34d399;
      --red: #dc2626;
      --red-bright: #ef4444;
      --amber: #d97706;
      --amber-text: #fbbf24;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }

    /* Botões & Inputs */
    button {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    button:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    input, select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--bg-input);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
    }
    input:focus, select:focus { border-color: var(--sky-hover); }
    label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    /* TELA 1: LOGIN */
    #loginScreen {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #0c2d48 0%, #020617 65%);
    }
    .login-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
    }
    .brand-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .brand-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .brand-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--sky-text);
    }
    .brand-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .brand-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .icon-btn {
      padding: 9px;
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .status-pill {
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
      color: var(--amber-text);
    }
    .status-pill.connected {
      background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.14);
      border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.35);
      color: var(--emerald-text);
    }
    .status-pill button {
      background: transparent;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: underline;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px;
      background: var(--sky);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--sky-hover); }
    .error-box {
      background: rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.55);
      border: 1px solid #991b1b;
      color: #fca5a5;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .login-footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* TOPBAR COMPARTILHADA */
    .topbar {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      padding: 8px 13px;
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #334155; }

    /* TELA 2: GUARDA-VIDAS */
    #gvScreen, #centralScreen { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .gv-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 16px;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .posto-item {
      background: #090d16;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 13px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }
    .posto-item.locked { opacity: 0.65; border-color: var(--border); }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .badge-green { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16); color: var(--emerald-text); }
    .badge-red { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18); color: #fca5a5; }
    .badge-amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18); color: var(--amber-text); }
    .badge-gray { background: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; }

    .nature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .nature-btn {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: #090d16;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .nature-btn.selected {
      border-color: var(--red-bright);
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.22);
      color: #fff;
    }

    @keyframes pulse-sos {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.75); }
      70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 28px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(239, 68, 68, 0); }
    }
    .sos-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 18px 0;
    }
    #sosTriggerBtn {
      width: 215px;
      height: 215px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ef4444 0%, #b91c1c 100%);
      border: 8px solid #450a0a;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      animation: pulse-sos 1.6s infinite;
    }
    #sosTriggerBtn .sos-big { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; }
    #sosTriggerBtn .sos-sub { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-top: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* TELA 3: CENTRAL */
    .tab-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      background: #090d16;
      padding: 4px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .central-tab {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .central-tab.active {
      background: var(--sky);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .monitor-grid {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 1fr;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
    }
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .monitor-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      #map { min-height: 360px !important; }
    }
    #map { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 460px; background: #0f172a; }
    .side-panel {
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      overflow-y: auto;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
    }
    .panel-section { padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .alert-card {
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--red-bright);
      background: rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.45);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .alert-card.ciente {
      border-color: var(--amber);
      background: rgba(120, 53, 15, 0.3);
    }
    .admin-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .admin-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .grid-2, .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    pre {
      background: #090d16;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      font-size: 11px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      max-height: 400px;
      color: #6ee7b7;
    }

    /* MODAL */
    .modal-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2000;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .modal-box {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 18px;
      max-width: 440px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    /* MARCADORES LEAFLET */
    .leaflet-marker-icon.sos-marker { background: transparent; border: none; }
    .marker-ping {
      width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ef4444; border: 3px solid #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px #ef4444;
    }
    .posto-marker {
      width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #0ea5e9; border: 2px solid #fff;
    }
    .posto-marker.occupied { background: #10b981; }
    .posto-marker.inactive { background: #64748b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <!-- TELA 1: LOGIN & ACESSO RESTRITO                           -->
  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <section id="loginScreen">
    <div class="login-card">
      <div class="brand-row">
        <div class="brand-left">
          <div class="brand-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="brand-title">OLHO NO MAR</div>
            <div class="brand-sub">Sistema Operacional de Salvamento Aquático</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="icon-btn" onclick="openCloudModal()" title="Configurar Servidor Supabase">⚙️</button>
      </div>

      <div id="cloudStatusBadge" class="status-pill">
        <span>Banco Local Ativo</span>
        <button onclick="openCloudModal()">Conectar Servidor</button>
      </div>

      <form onsubmit="handleLogin(event)">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>E-mail ou Login Funcional</label>
          <input id="loginEmail" type="email" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="usuario@olhonomar.gov.br" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Senha</label>
          <input id="loginPassword" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••" />
        </div>
        <div id="loginError" class="error-box hidden"></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Acessar Sistema</button>
      </form>

      <div class="login-footer">
        Acesso restrito a operadores autorizados da Central e Guarda-Vidas cadastrados.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <!-- TELA 2: GUARDA-VIDAS (CHECK-IN EXCLUSIVO + BOTÃO SOS)     -->
  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <section id="gvScreen" class="hidden">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div>
        <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:900;">OLHO NO MAR • AGENTE</div>
        <div id="gvUserLabel" style="font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;">Agente Conectado</div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="logout()">Sair</button>
    </header>

    <!-- ETAPA A: CHECK-IN DE POSTO EXCLUSIVO -->
    <div id="gvCheckinStep" class="gv-container">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-green" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Check-in de Serviço</span>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800;">Escolha o Posto de Atuação</h3>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:14px;">
          Postos já assumidos por outro guarda-vidas ou com coordenadas em uso ficam bloqueados automaticamente.
        </p>

        <div id="gvCheckinAlert" class="error-box hidden"></div>
        <div id="gvPostoList" style="max-height:330px; overflow-y:auto;"></div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid #1e293b; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;">
          <span id="gvCheckinGpsStatus">Verificando GPS do aparelho...</span>
          <button onclick="refreshGps()" style="background:transparent; color:#38bdf8; padding:0;">Atualizar GPS</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ETAPA B: BOTÃO SOS -->
    <div id="gvSosStep" class="gv-container hidden">
      <div class="card" style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:10px; font-weight:800; color:#34d399; text-transform:uppercase;">Em Serviço • Posto Exclusivo</div>
          <div id="gvActivePostoName" style="font-size:16px; font-weight:900; margin-top:2px;">Posto</div>
          <div id="gvActiveCoords" class="mono" style="font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8; margin-top:2px;">0.00000, 0.00000</div>
        </div>
        <button onclick="releaseCurrentPosto()" style="padding:9px 12px; background:rgba(245,158,11,0.16); border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.4); color:#fbbf24; font-size:11px;">
          Encerrar Turno / Trocar
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding:14px;">
        <label>Natureza da Ocorrência (Opcional)</label>
        <div class="nature-grid">
          <button type="button" onclick="selectNature('Afogamento / Resgate')" data-nature="Afogamento / Resgate" class="nature-btn selected">🌊 Afogamento</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="selectNature('Apoio Médico / Trauma')" data-nature="Apoio Médico / Trauma" class="nature-btn">🚑 Apoio Médico</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="selectNature('Embarcação / Moto Aquática')" data-nature="Embarcação / Moto Aquática" class="nature-btn">🚤 Embarcação</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="selectNature('Busca / Desaparecido')" data-nature="Busca / Desaparecido" class="nature-btn">🔍 Busca na Orla</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sos-wrap">
        <button id="sosTriggerBtn" onclick="triggerSosAlert()">
          <span class="sos-big">SOS</span>
          <span class="sos-sub">Apertar Emergência</span>
        </button>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; text-align:center; margin-top:16px; max-width:290px;">
          Um toque envia imediatamente a localização deste posto para a sirene da Central.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="gvStatusBanner" class="card hidden" style="text-align:center;"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <!-- TELA 3: CENTRAL DE COMANDO                                -->
  <!-- ========================================================= -->
  <section id="centralScreen" class="hidden">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div>
        <div style="font-size:15px; font-weight:900;">OLHO NO MAR • CENTRAL</div>
        <div id="centralOperatorInfo" style="font-size:11px; color:#94a3b8;">Operador Logado</div>
      </div>

      <nav class="tab-bar">
        <button onclick="switchCentralTab('monitor')" id="tabBtn-monitor" class="central-tab active">Monitoramento & Mapa</button>
        <button onclick="switchCentralTab('admin')" id="tabBtn-admin" class="central-tab">Agentes & Postos</button>
        <button onclick="switchCentralTab('deploy')" id="tabBtn-deploy" class="central-tab">Servidor, SQL & LoRa</button>
      </nav>

      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;">
        <button id="audioUnlockBtn" onclick="unlockAudio()" style="padding:8px 12px; background:rgba(245,158,11,0.16); border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.45); color:#fbbf24; font-size:12px;">
          🔊 Ativar Sirene
        </button>
        <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="testSiren()">Testar Som</button>
        <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="logout()">Sair</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ABA 1: MONITORAMENTO & MAPA -->
    <div id="tab-monitor" class="monitor-grid">
      <div id="map"></div>
      <div class="side-panel">
        <div class="panel-section">
          <div class="section-title" style="color:#f87171;">
            <span>🚨 Alertas SOS Ativos (<span id="activeAlertCount">0</span>)</span>
            <button onclick="exportAlertsCsv()" style="background:transparent; color:#38bdf8; font-size:11px; padding:0;">Exportar CSV</button>
          </div>
          <div id="activeAlertsList"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-section">
          <div class="section-title" style="color:#34d399;">
            <span>Efetivo em Serviço nos Postos (<span id="activeShiftCount">0</span>)</span>
          </div>
          <div id="activeShiftsList"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-section" style="border-bottom:none;">
          <div class="section-title" style="color:#94a3b8;">
            <span>Histórico Encerrado</span>
          </div>
          <div id="historyAlertsList"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ABA 2: AGENTES & POSTOS -->
    <div id="tab-admin" class="admin-container hidden">
      <div class="card">
        <h2 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">1. Cadastro Individual por Pessoa</h2>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; margin:4px 0 14px;">
          Cadastre cada guarda-vidas com login e senha próprios. Ao entrar, o agente escolhe o posto livre em que vai atuar.
        </p>

        <form onsubmit="handleCreateUser(event)" style="background:#090d16; padding:14px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid #1e293b; margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <div>
              <label>Nome Completo</label>
              <input id="newUserName" type="text" required placeholder="Ex: Sd. Carlos Silva" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Matrícula / ID</label>
              <input id="newUserBadge" type="text" required placeholder="Ex: GV-104" class="mono" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <div>
              <label>E-mail / Login</label>
              <input id="newUserEmail" type="email" required placeholder="carlos@olhonomar.gov.br" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Senha</label>
              <input id="newUserPass" type="text" required minlength="6" placeholder="Mín. 6 dígitos" class="mono" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Perfil</label>
              <select id="newUserRole">
                <option value="guarda_vidas">Guarda-Vidas</option>
                <option value="central">Operador Central</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">+ Cadastrar Pessoa no Sistema</button>
        </form>

        <div id="usersTableList" style="max-height:340px; overflow-y:auto;"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 style="font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">2. Postos de Guarda-Vidas & Coordenadas</h2>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; margin:4px 0 14px;">
          Cadastre os postos da orla ou clique diretamente no mapa na aba de Monitoramento para capturar latitude e longitude.
        </p>

        <form onsubmit="handleSavePosto(event)" style="background:#090d16; padding:14px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid #1e293b; margin-bottom:14px;">
          <input type="hidden" id="editPostoId" />
          <div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
            <div>
              <label>Nome do Posto</label>
              <input id="postoName" type="text" required placeholder="Ex: Posto 04 - Pina" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label>Latitude</label>
